{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-9","name":"off","text":"俺はただ\r\n普通の人間に────","trans":"我只是\n想当个普通的人————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018020010","name":"ルカ","text":"バカ！\r\nここ何階だと────","trans":"笨蛋！\n你知不知道这里几楼————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018020020","name":"冬優子","text":"…………よかった\r\nバルコニーだから大丈夫です","trans":"…………太好了\n是阳台，所以没事的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018020030","name":"冬優子","text":"どうしちゃったのかな\r\nお兄ちゃん……","trans":"到底怎么了呢\n哥哥……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018020040","name":"ルカ","text":"…………余計なお世話だったんだろう\r\n翼には────","trans":"…………大概是我多管闲事了吧\n对翼来说————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-51","name":"翼","text":"…………\r\nこれでいい……","trans":"…………\n这样就好……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-53","name":"翼","text":"ぬるま湯から抜け出すには\r\nこうするしか────","trans":"要摆脱这温水\n只能这么做————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018020080","name":"霧子","text":"……あははっ\r\nやっぱり……！","trans":"……啊哈哈\n果然……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-86","name":"翼","text":"なんで…………","trans":"为什么…………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018020090","name":"霧子","text":"わかるよ\r\n翼くんのことなら","trans":"我明白的\n只要是翼的事","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018020100","name":"霧子","text":"お腹空いてるんじゃないかなーって思ってさ","trans":"我就在想，你是不是饿了呢","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-90","name":"翼","text":"だ、だから\r\n俺は食べたくなんか────","trans":"所、所以\n我根本不想吃————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018020110","name":"霧子","text":"正直でよろしい……！","trans":"能坦白就好……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018020120","name":"霧子","text":"ね、なんで逃げるの？","trans":"呐，为什么要逃呢？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-99","name":"翼","text":"なんでって…………","trans":"要说为什么…………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018020130","name":"霧子","text":"お弁当、おいしくない？\r\nやっぱり迷惑だったかな…………","trans":"便当，不好吃吗？\n果然还是给你添麻烦了吧…………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-101","name":"翼","text":"────\r\nそんなわけ……！","trans":"————\n怎么可能……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-105","name":"翼","text":"俺の体…………おかしいんだ","trans":"我的身体…………不正常了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-107","name":"翼","text":"みんなからもらえるものしか\r\nどんどん受け付けなくなってて…………","trans":"我渐渐只能接受\n大家给我的东西了…………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-108","name":"翼","text":"ちゃんとした普通の人間にならなきゃ\r\n…………このままじゃ俺はダメになる","trans":"我得成为正经的普通人\n…………再这样下去我就完了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018020140","name":"霧子","text":"大丈夫だよ\r\nみんな、翼くんのことが大好きだから","trans":"没事的\n因为大家都最喜欢翼了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-110","name":"翼","text":"でも、俺は何もお返しできない\r\nしてもらってばかりで…………","trans":"可是，我什么也回报不了\n总是光接受大家的…………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018020150","name":"霧子","text":"翼くんは食べてくれるだけでいいんだよ","trans":"翼只要肯吃就好了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018020160","name":"霧子","text":"そのためのお弁当だもん！\r\n食べたいなら食べちゃいけないなんてないんだよ","trans":"便当就是为了这个嘛！\n说想吃却不能吃，这种事是没有的哦","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-125","name":"翼","text":"痛っ！？","trans":"好痛！？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-128","name":"翼","text":"────……ルカ、先輩……！","trans":"————……路加、前辈……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-132","name":"翼","text":"先輩……？","trans":"前辈……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-135","name":"翼","text":"……あっ\r\nありが────","trans":"……啊\n谢谢————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018020190","name":"ルカ","text":"食べなよ、ちゃんと","trans":"好好吃吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-139","name":"翼","text":"あの……！\r\nありがとうございます……先輩！","trans":"那个……！\n非常感谢……前辈！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-148","name":"翼","text":"────っ\r\n冬優子…………","trans":"————唔\n冬优子…………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018020210","name":"冬優子","text":"あの、ほんと\r\n無理しなくていいから","trans":"那个，真的\n你不用勉强自己的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018020220","name":"冬優子","text":"お腹空いた時に食べてね","trans":"肚子饿的时候再吃吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-153","name":"翼","text":"あ、冬優子……！","trans":"啊，冬优子……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-158","name":"翼","text":"みんな…………","trans":"大家…………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-161","name":"off","text":"そっか\r\n俺────","trans":"这样啊\n我————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-173","name":"翼","text":"うん…………\r\n相変わらず────","trans":"嗯…………\n还是老样子————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-176","name":"off","text":"噛めば噛むほど不思議な味がする\r\n────霧子の弁当","trans":"越嚼越觉得味道不可思议\n————雾子的便当","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-184","name":"off","text":"塩辛いけど癖になる\r\n────ルカ先輩の差し入れ","trans":"咸得让人上瘾\n————路加前辈送来的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-191","name":"off","text":"甘かったり辛かったり、濃い味付けの多い\r\n────冬優子の弁当","trans":"时甜时辣，重口味偏多\n————冬优子的便当","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-196","name":"翼","text":"でも────ウマい…………","trans":"可是————好吃…………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-203","name":"翼","text":"────？\r\n…………胃がなんか、むずむず……────","trans":"————？\n…………胃里怎么，痒痒的……————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-205","name":"翼","text":"…………！？\r\nは、腹が……────","trans":"…………！？\n肚、肚子……————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-208","name":"off","text":"────そうだった","trans":"————是这样啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-213","name":"off","text":"前にもこうやって\r\n風船みたいに…………","trans":"以前也这样\n像气球一样…………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-218","name":"off","text":"だから\r\n俺は──────","trans":"所以\n我——————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018020230","name":"霧子","text":"どうしたの…………？","trans":"怎么了…………？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018020240","name":"霧子","text":"────……\r\n寝ぼけてる、のかな……","trans":"————……\n是睡迷糊了吗……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018020250","name":"霧子","text":"ふふ……\r\nもう大丈夫だよ……","trans":"呵呵……\n已经没事了哦……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}